A lead-in before loop recording (Segno: docs/design/recording.md §5).

tracktion's loop recording always starts at the loop (or the count-in before it). Segno records
inside the loop brace while looping and lets you start earlier: playback rolls into the loop from
the playhead, so the bars before it are heard but not recorded. The count-in's clicks keep their
own range.

